hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22678","Abu Abd al-Rahman al-Muqri, Abd Allah ibn Yazid, narrated to us, Haywah narrated to us, Abu Sakhr narrated to us, that he heard Makhul say: Abu Hind al-Dari narrated to me, that he heard the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, say: Whoever stands a standing of showing off and seeking repute, Allah the Exalted will make show of him and repute of him on the Day of Resurrection."
